{"id":"01a04565-2c33-7b65-9fd9-808974f86465","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.4.2.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.4.2.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: Schnorr48 verify\",\"notes\":\"Already implemented\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:11.969093Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T22:43:01.545162Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-27T22:43:01.545162Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T22:48:01.545162Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T22:43:01.545162Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.4.2.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.4.2\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:43:13.008294Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Already implemented\\nVerified complete without edits. Core schnorr48_verify enforces exact 48-byte signatures, rejects NULL/nonzero messages, invalid/low-order keys, zero response scalars, non-canonical s via Monocypher recover_r, and uses crypto_verify16 for constant-time challenge equality without mutating caller buffers. Canonical C corpus covers six valid signatures plus wrong message/key, tampered challenge/response, 47-byte signature, all-zero signature, identity/8-torsion pubkeys, s=L, and zero-s. Validation: fresh UBSan C ctest 1/1 and schnorr48_test 9/9; clean LINK-v1/SIID interop C ctest 1/1 (all six independent PyNaCl signatures); Python Schnorr + signed-frame tests 40 passed; Rust schnorr48_vectors 2/2 and shared_vectors 6/6 passed. Scoped mtimes unchanged; no files modified by this leaf.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T22:44:13.491747Z"}
